          "heading": "Fiji's peak world ranking of No. 7 came in 2023",
          "body": "In their three Nations Championship games so far, Fiji have no wins and three defeats, with 49 points scored and 145 conceded, leaving them 11th of 12 in the log. Their points difference stands at -96. Their most recent result is a 34-28 win over Japan; their next match, in Round 4, is away to France."
