      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Borthwick restores George Furbank at full-back as Fin Smith passes fitness test",
          "body": "Fin Smith has been deemed fit to face Australia after a build-up injury scare, and has started England's past five matches, usurping George Ford in the process. George Furbank has been out of the Test side since November 2024, with injuries and an appendicitis bout in the July window keeping him away. Greg Fisilau, the Exeter Chiefs back-rower, is in the matchday squad and in line for a maiden cap."
        },
