      }
    },
    "387": {
      "date": "2026-11-08",
      "edition": "Sunday 8 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Recent form",
          "heading": "France have won three of their last five, most recently against Japan",
          "body": "Across their last five matches, France have won three and lost two, with results running win, win, loss, win, loss, most recent first. Their current run is two straight wins, and the latest of them was a 42-15 victory away to Japan, which was Round 3 of the Nations Championship Group Stage in July. In that group they have played three, won two and lost one."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Springboks beat Italy 66-7",
          "body": "Italy's Tommaso Menoncello out 12 weeks with shoulder injury. England recall George Furbank at full-back; Fin Smith passes fitness test. Wallabies' Fraser McReight earns 50th cap against England."
