    "388": {
      "date": "2026-11-08",
      "edition": "Sunday 8 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury check",
          "heading": "Ireland injury list grows after Dan Sheehan fails head injury assessment against Argentina",
          "body": "Sheehan was taken off in the first half of Friday's 42-12 win after failing a head injury assessment, though Andy Farrell said he \"seems fine in the dressing room\". Robert Baloucoune also left with a knock, going off in the 58th minute, while Sean Jansen sustained a \"bang\" to his knee. Josh van der Flier and Mack Hansen both have ankle concerns, and Hansen continued after treatment. Those two were part of a back three that had only played together once before, four years ago against South Africa."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Springboks beat Italy 66-7",
          "body": "Italy's Tommaso Menoncello out 12 weeks with shoulder injury. England recall George Furbank at full-back; Fin Smith passes fitness test. Wallabies' Fraser McReight earns 50th cap against England."
        }
      ],
      "source": {
