          "kicker": "Classic title defence",
          "heading": "Argentina Legends open World Rugby Classic title defence against Italian Classic XV",
          "body": "The Legends, seeking an eighth title, want early league points before a week that also takes them to France Classic Rugby on Tuesday and the Classic Lions on Friday. Last year they won the trophy with a 13-7 victory over the Classic Springboks. Tournament president John Kane said \"Argentina will be favourites and the Lions will be second favourites.\" The match is part of the 38th edition of the tournament."
        },
