          "heading": "Fraser McReight to earn 50th cap as Jeremy Williams starts at six",
          "body": "Fraser McReight will earn his 50th cap for Australia against England at Allianz Stadium, Twickenham, forming a new-look back row with Jeremy Williams at blindside flanker and Harry Wilson, who captains the side again from number eight. Len Ikitau returns to midfield after missing the last Test under HIA protocols, alongside Isaac Henry, who plays his first Test in the United Kingdom. Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii is back at the venue of his 2024 Test debut, on the right wing."
