          "body": "Riku Kitahara, the Honda Heat fly-half, has been picked to start in Cardiff, with Shinya Komura on the bench as Japan's only other fly-half option on tour. Kitahara has not yet won a cap. The selection comes with Sam Greene and Seung-sin Lee both injured, and Ryunosuke Ito, who has started all of Japan's Tests in 2026, back at university and missing the entire tour."
