          "heading": "Jeff Wilson says Richie Mo'unga misses Scotland clash as Barrett's form grows",
          "body": "Dave Rennie's 10-and-15 picture is tightening. Jeff Wilson told Sport Nation that Richie Mo'unga, who is targeting Wales, will not be available for the Scotland match. Beauden Barrett, 35, has moved into the 15 jersey and is dovetailing with Damian McKenzie at 10, a pairing retained for the Nations Championship opener. Wilson says Barrett's form could give the selectors headaches, since McKenzie was Rennie's preferred 15 before the Bledisloe Cup. Ruben Love's return next season is also a factor."
