          "heading": "Mzwandile Stick says Springboks will go all out in remaining Tests",
          "body": "Assistant coach Mzwandile Stick told the media on Friday, before the 66-7 win over Italy, that the Springboks are determined to win each of their remaining Tests. He said there is no room to ease off, with the All Blacks also chasing every win. On injuries, Stick said the squad had depth to cope: \"So if there are injuries, we know one thing for sure: the other guys will be ready.\" The Boks still have Ireland in Dublin and France in Paris before the finals weekend at Twickenham."
